  <h2>2. A to Z Master Command Directory</h2>

  <h3>A</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!antinuke [subcommand]</code> / <code>/config antinuke</code> — Central Anti-Nuke zero-trust engine control suite (<code>status</code>, <code>threshold</code>, <code>punishment</code>, <code>trustedactor</code>, <code>timeout-duration</code>, <code>quarantine-role</code>, <code>setall</code>).</li>
    <li><code>r!antispam &lt;on|off&gt; [max_msgs] [window_sec] [action]</code> / <code>/automod antispam</code> — Configure anti-spam flood filters.</li>
    <li><code>r!antilink [on|off]</code> / <code>/automod antilink</code> — Configure Anti-Link filter. Automatically deletes unauthorized link messages and sends DM warnings.</li>
    <li><code>r!autorole &lt;add|remove&gt; &lt;@role&gt;</code> / <code>/welcome autorole</code> — Auto-assign roles to new human joins.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>B</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!backup &lt;create|list|restore&gt;</code> / <code>/backup</code> — Take atomic snapshots of server channels, roles, and permissions for instant rollback recovery.</li>
    <li><code>r!ban &lt;@user&gt; [reason]</code> / <code>/ban</code> — Permanently ban violator accounts.</li>
    <li><code>r!blacklist &lt;add|remove|list&gt; [word]</code> / <code>/automod blacklist</code> — Manage blacklisted words.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>C</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!clear &lt;amount&gt;</code> / <code>r!purge &lt;amount&gt;</code> / <code>/purge</code> — Bulk delete up to 100 messages.</li>
    <li><code>r!config [module] [options...]</code> / <code>/config</code> — Master server control panel.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>E</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!emergency &lt;on|off|lockdown&gt;</code> / <code>/emergency</code> — Enable/disable server lockdown mode.</li>
    <li><code>r!extraowner &lt;add|remove|list&gt; &lt;@user&gt;</code> / <code>/extraowner</code> — Manage Extra Owners with 100% immunity.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>L</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!logging &lt;channel|status|set&gt;</code> / <code>/logging</code> — Configure security audit log channel.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>P</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!prebot &lt;add|remove|list&gt; &lt;bot_id&gt;</code> / <code>/prebot</code> — Pre-approve bots before join. Unapproved bots are banned on Action #1.</li>
    <li><code>r!prefix [set|reset]</code> / <code>/prefix</code> — Customize server command prefix (Default: <code>r!</code>).</li>
    <li><code>r!punishment &lt;event|all&gt; &lt;action&gt;</code> — Set anti-nuke punishment (<code>quarantine</code>, <code>ban</code>, <code>kick</code>, <code>strip_roles</code>, <code>warn</code>).</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Q</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!quarantine &lt;@user&gt; [reason]</code> / <code>/quarantine</code> — Apply Discord Timeout + Quarantine role.</li>
    <li><code>r!quarantine-role &lt;create|@role|view&gt;</code> / <code>r!qrole</code> — Auto-create or bind Quarantine role.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>R</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!restore</code> / <code>/restore</code> — Trigger full atomic restoration to rebuild missing channels/roles.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>T</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!threshold &lt;event|all&gt; &lt;limit&gt; [window_sec]</code> — Set maximum allowed actions within time window.</li>
    <li><code>r!timeout &lt;@user&gt; &lt;duration&gt; [reason]</code> / <code>/timeout</code> — Native Discord timeout.</li>
    <li><code>r!timeout-duration &lt;10m|1h|1d|7d|28d&gt;</code> / <code>r!timeouttime</code> — Configure Anti-Nuke timeout duration.</li>
    <li><code>r!trustedactor &lt;warn_at&gt; &lt;punish_at&gt; [window_sec]</code> — Configure Behavioral Firewall thresholds for Whitelisted users.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>U</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!unquarantine &lt;@user&gt;</code> / <code>/unquarantine</code> — Release quarantined user & restore roles.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>W</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><code>r!whitelist &lt;add|remove|list&gt; &lt;@user&gt;</code> / <code>/whitelist</code> — Manage Whitelisted Admin list.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Key Security Configurations</h2>
  <pre><code># Set Timeout Duration to 28 Days (Maximum)
r!config antinuke timeout-duration 28d

# Set Anti-Link to Warn & Delete
r!config antinuke punishment anti_link warn

# Set Master Anti-Nuke (1 Action / 10 Sec -> BAN + Auto-Restore)
r!config antinuke setall all 1 10 ban on

# Configure Trusted Actor Behavioral Gate
r!config antinuke trustedactor 1 2 10

# Auto-Create & Bind Quarantine Role
r!config antinuke quarantine-role create</code></pre>

